flashference patch 2/2: adaptive draft length (LLAMA_MTP_ADAPT*) and context-adaptive draft vocabulary (LLAMA_MTP_TRIM_FIXED, LLAMA_MTP_DYN)
Base: llama.cpp b11884 (63412d873) + patches/b4-trim-draft-head.patch (apply that one first, then this).
  git apply /path/to/flashference/patches/e2-e4-adaptive-n-dynamic-vocab.patch
Needed for the copy-heavy headline config (LLAMA_MTP_ADAPT=1 LLAMA_MTP_ADAPT_INIT=2 with --spec-type ngram-simple,draft-mtp).
All behaviour is off unless the env vars are set.
